AVGO,Broadcom,Technology,2019,"About Us
Broadcom Inc. is a global infrastructure technology leader built on 50 years of innovation, collaboration and engineering excellence.
With roots based in the rich technical heritage of AT&T/Bell Labs, Lucent and Hewlett-Packard/Agilent, Broadcom focuses on technologies that connect our world. Through the combination of industry leaders Avago Technologies, LSI, Broadcom Corporation, Brocade and CA Technologies, the company has the size, scope and engineering talent to lead the industry into the future.
Broadcom is focused on technology leadership and category-leading semiconductor and infrastructure software solutions. The company is a global leader in numerous product segments serving the world’s most successful companies.
Broadcom Inc. combines global scale, engineering depth, broad product portfolio diversity, superior execution and operational focus to deliver category-leading semiconductor and infrastructure software solutions so its customers can build and grow successful businesses in a constantly changing environment.",True,collaboration_teamwork;customer_focus;innovation;performance_results,"Substantial shift: the self-description changes to 'a global infrastructure technology leader built on 50 years of innovation, collaboration and engineering excellence', and 'infrastructure software' is introduced alongside semiconductors ('category-leading semiconductor and infrastructure software solutions'). Corporate history replaces product stories, with the merger of 'Avago Technologies, LSI, Broadcom Corporation, Brocade and CA Technologies' cited as the source of 'size, scope and engineering talent'. Consumer-facing language, patent and employee statistics, and the 'Connecting everything' tagline are no longer present, and the tone shifts toward customer business success ('so its customers can build and grow successful businesses').",ok,,broadcom.com/company,1,20190411161319,https://web.archive.org/web/20190411161319id_/https://www.broadcom.com/company/,140,2016,0.0809,substantive,"The 2019 page drops the 2016 self-description as a fabless chip designer and its innovation/product-patent and R&D claims, and reframes the company as a post-merger infrastructure technology leader emphasizing scale, execution and category leadership.",True,"General corporate About Us page describing the company's self-description, heritage and capabilities.","{""innovation"": ""Broadcom Inc. is a global infrastructure technology leader built on 50 years of innovation, collaboration and engineering excellence."", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""built on 50 years of innovation, collaboration and engineering excellence."", ""performance_results"": ""Broadcom Inc. combines global scale, engineering depth, broad product portfolio diversity, superior execution and operational focus to deliver category-leading semiconductor and infrastructure software solutions"", ""customer_focus"": ""so its customers can build and grow successful businesses in a constantly changing environment.""}",0,2,0,1,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0
