© 2018 American Express Company. All rights reserved.",True,customer_focus;innovation,"Changes are minor and mostly additive to the navigation, including 'Personal Loans' and 'Data-Driven Solutions'. The corporate tagline 'A heritage built on service and sustained by innovation' is retained, so the framing is essentially unchanged from 2017.",ok,,about.americanexpress.com,2,20180105134316,https://web.archive.org/web/20180105134316id_/http://about.americanexpress.com:80/?,659,2017,0.9329,cosmetic,"The 2018 page keeps the same self-description, tagline and mission wording as 2017, changing only the navigation items (adds Personal Loans and Data-Driven Solutions), press release listings and copyright year.",False,"This is a site-wide navigation and footer template page dominated by product links, account menus and press release listings; the only self-description is a brief tagline and summary, so it does not read as a general About overview page.","{""customer_focus"": ""We're a global services company that provides customers with access to products, insights and experiences that enrich lives and build business success."", ""innovation"": ""A heritage built on service and sustained by innovation.""}",0,2,0,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0
AXP,American Express,Financials,2019,"American Express at a Glance
Since 1850, American Express has worked to make a difference in our customers' lives in ways that matter most to them.
Learn More
Our Vision
Provide the world’s best customer experience every day.
Our Mission
Become essential to our customers by providing differentiated products and services to help them achieve their aspirations.
Our Values
We Deliver for Our Customers
We’re driven by our commitment to deliver exceptional products, services and experiences to our customers. We value our strong customer relationships, and are defined by how well we take care of them.
We Make It Great
We deliver an unparalleled standard of excellence in everything we do, staying focused on the biggest opportunities to be meaningful to our customers. From our innovative products to our world-class customer service, our customers expect the best —and our teams are proud to deliver it.
We Do What’s Right
Customers choose us because they trust our brand and people. We earn that trust by ensuring everything we do is reliable, consistent, and with the highest level of integrity.
We Respect People
We are a diverse and inclusive company, and serve diverse customers. We believe we are a better company when each of us feels included, valued, and able to trust colleagues who respect each of us for who we are and what we contribute to our collective success.
We Need Different Views
By being open to different ideas from our colleagues, customers and the world around us, we will find more ways to win.
We Win As a Team
We view each other as colleagues – part of the same team, striving to deliver the brand promise to our customers and each other every day. Individual performance is essential and valued; but never at the expense of the team.
We Care About Communities
We aim to make a difference in the communities where we work and live. Our commitment to corporate social responsibility makes an impact by strengthening our connections.",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;customer_focus;diversity_inclusion;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people,"The page is restructured around 'Our Vision' ('Provide the world's best customer experience every day'), 'Our Mission' ('Become essential to our customers') and six named Values, with 'Since 1850' introducing a historical frame. Vocabulary shifts to 'inclusive', 'diverse', 'integrity', 'communities' and 'corporate social responsibility', and the navigation and product promotions are removed.",ok,,about.americanexpress.com,2,20190102104828,https://web.archive.org/web/20190102104828id_/http://about.americanexpress.com/,330,2018,0.0404,substantive,"The 2019 page replaces the 2018 navigation-heavy product portal with an 'At a Glance' page setting out a vision, mission and a set of values (customers, excellence, integrity, respect and inclusion, team, communities), a substantive reframing of the company's self-description.",True,"Company overview page presenting vision, mission and values, consistent with a general About page.","{""customer_focus"": ""Provide the world’s best customer experience every day."", ""performance_results"": ""We deliver an unparalleled standard of excellence in everything we do"", ""innovation"": ""From our innovative products to our world-class customer service"", ""integrity_ethics"": ""We earn that trust by ensuring everything we do is reliable, consistent, and with the highest level of integrity."", ""respect_people"": ""We Respect People"", ""diversity_inclusion"": ""We are a diverse and inclusive company, and serve diverse customers."", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""We Win As a Team"", ""community_social_impact"": ""We aim to make a difference in the communities where we work and live.""}",0,1,2,2,2,2,2,2,0,2,0,0
