BLK,BlackRock,Financials,2020,"INVESTMENT INSIGHTS
Our thought leadership in investing, risk management, portfolio construction and trading solutions.
Who we are
BlackRock is a global investment manager with a commitment to help more and more people plan for their financial future. No matter what your goals may be, at BlackRock, we are invested in you.
BlackRock offers a range of solutions for institutions, financial professionals and individuals from all walks of life. From shop assistants in your local stores to national organizations and non-profits, BlackRock has helped people take control of their financial security for more than 30 years.
Source: BlackRock, as of January 2020.
Our purpose is to help more and more people experience financial well-being. In pursuit of this, a focus on long-term sustainability is embedded across our business. From integrating environmental, social and governance (ESG) practices into our investment processes to creating positive social impact by serving the communities in which we operate, we are dedicated to helping clients, employees, shareholders and communities achieve long-term, financial well-being.
Explore our site for more information on BlackRock's missions and principles, social impact activities and corporate sustainability.
BlackRock is designed to deliver a better solution for clients. We offer investment products from index and alpha to portfolio construction.
Our iShares exchange-traded funds (ETFs) offer diversified and low-cost ways to tap into the potential of the markets.
Aladdin produces a range of technology that seeks to provide investment professionals with the clarity to see, understand and act no matter how much the world changes.
We put an unwavering focus on long-term sustainability and ensure it is embedded across our entire business.
