COP,ConocoPhillips,Energy,2021,"About Us
ConocoPhillips is one of the world’s largest independent E&P companies based on production and proved reserves.
Across our 15 countries of operations, 9,800 people work in a truly integrated way to find and produce oil and natural gas.
Our technical capabilities, asset quality and scale, and financial strength are unmatched among independent exploration and production companies and uniquely position us to compete around the world.
ConocoPhillips is committed to the efficient and effective exploration and production of oil and natural gas. Producing oil and natural gas and getting them to market takes ingenuity, technology and investment. Our innovative, collaborative efforts yield products that improve quality of life globally while producing economic benefits with far-reaching influence.
Who We Are
We are challenged with an important job to safely find and deliver energy to the world.
Learn More
Our History
We have a long and proud history of finding and producing oil and gas. Through that history we have become a technical company committed to innovation and the responsible development of energy.
Learn More
What We Do
We explore for, produce, transport and market crude oil, natural gas, natural gas liquids, liquefied natural gas and bitumen on a worldwide basis - energy that plays a foundational role in enabling global economic development and human progress.
Learn More",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;innovation;performance_results;safety,"Notable structural and framing change: the page adds an opening 'About Us' header and the claim 'one of the world's largest independent E&P companies', plus new sections 'Who We Are' ('an important job to safely find and deliver energy'), 'Our History' (introducing 'responsible development of energy'), and 'What We Do' ('foundational role in enabling global economic development and human progress'). Footprint falls to 15 countries and 9,800 people.",ok,,conocophillips.com/about-us,1,20210126153347,https://web.archive.org/web/20210126153347id_/https://www.conocophillips.com/about-us/,217,2020,0.6139,substantive,"The 2021 page adds a company history section, self-description as one of the world's largest independent E&P companies, a responsible-development and safety framing, and updates headcount and country figures, adding new self-description and commitments not in the 2020 page.",True,"Corporate About Us page with self-description, history, and overview of what the company does.","{""innovation"": ""Through that history we have become a technical company committed to innovation and the responsible development of energy."", ""performance_results"": ""Our technical capabilities, asset quality and scale, and financial strength are unmatched among independent exploration and production companies and uniquely position us to compete around the world."", ""safety"": ""We are challenged with an important job to safely find and deliver energy to the world."", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""Our innovative, collaborative efforts yield products that improve quality of life globally while producing economic benefits with far-reaching influence."", ""community_social_impact"": ""energy that plays a foundational role in enabling global economic development and human progress.""}",0,2,0,0,1,1,0,0,0,1,0,1
