COP,ConocoPhillips,Energy,2023,"About Us
ConocoPhillips is one of the world’s largest independent E&P companies based on production and proved reserves.
Across our 13 countries of operations, 9,500 people work in a truly integrated way to find and produce oil and natural gas.
Our technical capabilities, asset quality and scale, and financial strength are unmatched among independent exploration and production companies and uniquely position us to compete around the world.
ConocoPhillips is committed to the efficient and effective exploration and production of oil and natural gas. Producing oil and natural gas and getting them to market takes ingenuity, technology and investment. Our innovative, collaborative efforts yield products that improve quality of life globally while producing economic benefits with far-reaching influence.
Who We Are
We are challenged with an important job to safely find and deliver energy to the world.
Integrating Sustainability
We are focused on sustainably meeting energy demand, while creating lasting value for employees, communities and shareholders.
Our History
We have a long and proud history of finding and producing oil and gas. Through that history we have become a technical company committed to innovation and the responsible development of energy.
What We Do
We explore for, produce, transport and market crude oil, natural gas, natural gas liquids, liquefied natural gas and bitumen on a worldwide basis - energy that plays a foundational role in enabling global economic development and human progress.",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;environment_sustainability;innovation;performance_results;safety,"Introduces the first explicit stakeholder-oriented values statement under 'Integrating Sustainability': 'focused on sustainably meeting energy demand, while creating lasting value for employees, communities and shareholders.' The sustainability language is now substantive, and the leading claim reverts to 'one of the world's largest'. Footprint is 13 countries and 9,500 people.",ok,,conocophillips.com/about-us,1,20230220204634,https://web.archive.org/web/20230220204634id_/https://www.conocophillips.com/about-us/,230,2022,0.9433,substantive,"A new Integrating Sustainability statement commits to sustainably meeting energy demand and creating lasting value for employees, communities and shareholders, adding sustainability and community themes; other changes (country count, headcount, the word one of) are cosmetic updates.",True,"Company overview page with self-description, mission-style statements and history, consistent with a general About Us page.","{""innovation"": ""Through that history we have become a technical company committed to innovation and the responsible development of energy."", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""Our innovative, collaborative efforts yield products that improve quality of life globally"", ""performance_results"": ""Our technical capabilities, asset quality and scale, and financial strength are unmatched among independent exploration and production companies"", ""safety"": ""We are challenged with an important job to safely find and deliver energy to the world."", ""environment_sustainability"": ""We are focused on sustainably meeting energy demand, while creating lasting value for employees, communities and shareholders."", ""community_social_impact"": ""creating lasting value for employees, communities and shareholders""}",0,2,0,0,1,2,0,0,1,1,0,1
