 revenues""}",0,2,0,2,1,1,0,0,0,1,0,0
CRM,Salesforce,Technology,2020,"We believe everyone can be a Trailblazer, and we’re building the technology to make it happen.
The Fourth Industrial Revolution is changing the way people work, using robotics, AI, the Internet of Things, and more. By making these innovations easier and more accessible, we’re helping create a future with greater opportunity and equality for all.
Together, we’re creating a future of new opportunities.
Trailblazers don’t fear change, we embrace it. We harness new technologies to entirely transform our companies, our careers, and, hopefully, our world.
Welcome to our Ohana.
Our Ohana, a Hawaiian word for intentional family, is guided by four core values that serve as the foundation for our decisions, actions, and communication.
We have a history of helping companies, and the people behind them, grow.
In 1999, we pioneered cloud-based CRM software and have helped 150,000+ companies run their companies more effectively. Now, we’re creating an economy that will help millions of people find career satisfaction and enjoy better lives as well.
Meet our leadership.
Meet our leadership.
Our success depends upon our customers’ success.
Every day, more than 150,000 companies are increasing employee productivity, team collaboration, customer loyalty, and, most importantly, sales revenues using the world’s #1 CRM platform.
These are the rewards of putting our customers first.
Our innovative cloud-based platform earns accolades from press around the world, but it’s our dedication to customer success that has helped us become the world’s fourth-largest software company.
* Source: IDC, Worldwide Semiannual Software Tracker, October 2019. CRM market includes the following IDC-defined functional markets: Sales Force Productivity and Management, Marketing Campaign Management, Customer Service, Contact Center, Advertising, and Digital Commerce Applications.",True,community_social_impact;customer_focus;diversity_inclusion;innovation;performance_results,"Adds 'We believe everyone can be a Trailblazer', 'Together, we're creating a future of new opportunities', and 'Welcome to our Ohana', plus a 'Meet our leadership' section and 'putting our customers first'. The IDC market-share source note is introduced.",ok,,salesforce.com/company,1,20200204152208,https://web.archive.org/web/20200204152208id_/https://www.salesforce.com/company/,273,2019,0.784,substantive,"The 2020 page adds explicit customer-first commitments ('These are the rewards of putting our customers first'), an inclusion statement ('everyone can be a Trailblazer'), and new framing around leadership and the Ohana culture, while retaining the 2019 innovation and opportunity messaging.",True,"Company overview page covering self-description, values (Ohana core values), history, and leadership links.","{""innovation"": ""Our innovative cloud-based platform earns accolades from press around the world"", ""customer_focus"": ""Our success depends upon our customers’ success."", ""performance_results"": ""using the world’s #1 CRM platform."", ""community_social_impact"": ""Now, we’re creating an economy that will help millions of people find career satisfaction and enjoy better lives as well."", ""diversity_inclusion"": ""We believe everyone can be a Trailblazer, and we’re building the technology to make it happen.""}",0,2,0,2,0,1,0,1,0,1,0,0
