HAL,Halliburton,Energy,2021,"Halliburton is one of the world's largest providers of products and services for the ever-evolving needs of the energy industry.
Founded in 1919, Halliburton serves major, national and independent oil and natural gas companies throughout the world. Halliburton and our 40,000+ global employees collaborate and engineer solutions to maximize asset value for our customers. Our execution culture focuses on continuous improvement. Our values guide us to achieve more in how we relate to each other and everyone with whom we interact.
Our experts collaborate and engineer solutions to help customers maximize value throughout the lifecycle of the reservoir. We combine technology, services and execution expertise to assist our customers with hydrocarbons location, geological data management, drilling and formation evaluation, well construction and completion, and production optimization throughout the life of their asset.
Employees that form a talented, global team
Nationalities represented across the world
Countries that work together to streamline operations
Exceptional experiences require exceptional values. Our values guide us in everything we do, underpinning how we relate to each other and everyone with whom we interact.
Ethics and integrity are the foundation of our brand and the guiding principles for all we do.
Priority number one. We are focused on our own personal safety as well as the safety of others.
We work together with customers and understand that everyone has a role in providing the best solution.
We compete to win. We know that competition makes everyone stronger.
We are resourceful. We are innovative and strive to apply the right technology and solution every time.
We deliver what we promise. We believe the quality of our service defines who we are.
We value diversity and equality. It makes us stronger, more innovative, and better positioned for success. We are committed to inclusion across race, gender, nationality, religion, identity, experience, and any other unique attribute. We are honest with ourselves, welcome different viewpoints, and empower each other to be authentic.
Continuous improvement is built into all facets of our business, from R&D, to team building, delivering sustainable solutions, and meeting the needs of our customers, shareholders, and global communities.
Our dedicated executives have the knowledge and experience to deliver successful results.
How our strategy for sustainability serves as the cornerstone of our operations and our future.
Haliburton selected as a 2020 Winner by OTC for our Xaminer® Magnetic Resonance (XMR™) service.
Enhancing the economic and social well-being of the communities where we live and operate is among our most enduring principles.
Collaboration is a priority—you’ll hear that said by many companies—but we’re actually doing it.",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;customer_focus;diversity_inclusion;environment_sustainability;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people;safety,"Substantial rewrite: the opening becomes 'for the ever-evolving needs of the energy industry', adds 'execution culture focuses on continuous improvement', and introduces a values section ('Exceptional experiences require exceptional values') with explicit 'We value diversity and equality' and 'committed to inclusion across race, gender, nationality, religion, identity' language, plus 'Ethics and integrity' and 'Priority number one' safety framing. Shareholders appear alongside customers and global communities, and 'collaborate and engineer solutions' is repeated, marking a shift toward values-based and stakeholder-oriented language.",ok,,halliburton.com/en/about-us.html,1,20210910143410,https://web.archive.org/web/20210910143410id_/https://www.halliburton.com/en/about-us.html,426,2020,0.1846,substantive,"The 2021 page adds explicit values statements on safety, ethics and integrity, innovation, diversity and equality, collaboration and competition, and a stronger focus on execution and performance, while the 2020 page centred on describing the business and sustainability.",True,"Company overview page describing Halliburton's self-description, values, and operations, consistent with a general About page.","{""collaboration_teamwork"": ""Halliburton and our 40,000+ global employees collaborate and engineer solutions to maximize asset value for our customers."", ""integrity_ethics"": ""Ethics and integrity are the foundation of our brand and the guiding principles for all we do."", ""safety"": ""Priority number one. We are focused on our own personal safety as well as the safety of others."", ""innovation"": ""We are resourceful. We are innovative and strive to apply the right technology and 