LLY,Eli Lilly,Healthcare,2016,"We were founded in 1876 by Colonel Eli Lilly, a man committed to creating high-quality medicines that met real needs in an era of unreliable elixirs peddled by questionable characters. His charge to the generations of employees who have followed was this: “Take what you find here and make it better and better.”
More than 140 years later, we remain committed to his vision through every aspect of our business and the people we serve starting with those who take our medicines, and extending to health care professionals, employees and the communities in which we live.

Our promise
Lilly unites caring with discovery to make life better for people around the world.

Our mission
We make medicines that help people live longer, healthier, more active lives.

Our vision
We will make a significant contribution to humanity by improving global health in the 21st century.

Our values
Integrity, excellence and respect for people.",,community_social_impact;customer_focus;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people,"Baseline framing is heritage-led and mission-driven: founder Colonel Eli Lilly and 'high-quality medicines that met real needs' open the page, followed by a 'Our promise', 'Our mission' ('help people live longer, healthier, more active lives') and 'Our vision' ('a significant contribution to humanity'). Values are listed briefly as 'Integrity, excellence and respect for people.'",ok,,lilly.com/who-we-are,1,20161125174251,https://web.archive.org/web/20161125174251id_/https://www.lilly.com/who-we-are,152,,,no_prior,,True,"Company overview page covering founding history, promise, mission, vision and values.","{""integrity_ethics"": ""Integrity, excellence and respect for people."", ""performance_results"": ""Integrity, excellence and respect for people."", ""respect_people"": ""Integrity, excellence and respect for people."", ""customer_focus"": ""the people we serve starting with those who take our medicines"", ""community_social_impact"": ""Lilly unites caring with discovery to make life better for people around the world."", ""innovation"": ""Lilly unites caring with discovery to make life better for people around the world.""}",0,2,1,1,0,2,2,0,0,2,0,0
LLY,Eli Lilly,Healthcare,2017,"We were founded in 1876 by Colonel Eli Lilly, a man committed to creating high-quality medicines that met real needs in an era of unreliable elixirs peddled by questionable characters. His charge to the generations of employees who have followed was this: “Take what you find here and make it better and better.”
More than 140 years later, we remain committed to his vision through every aspect of our business and the people we serve starting with those who take our medicines, and extending to health care professionals, employees and the communities in which we live.

Our promise
Lilly unites caring with discovery to make life better for people around the world.

Our mission
We make medicines that help people live longer, healthier, more active lives.

Our vision
We will make a significant contribution to humanity by improving global health in the 21st century.

Our values
Integrity, excellence and respect for people.
Three long established core values guide Lilly in all that we do:
- Integrity: We conduct our business consistent with all applicable laws and are honest in our dealings with customers, employees, shareholders, partners, suppliers, competitors and the community.
- Excellence: We pursue pharmaceutical innovation, provide high quality products and strive to deliver superior business results.
- Respect for People: We maintain an environment built on mutual respect, openness and individual integrity. Respect for people includes our concern for all people who touch or are touched by our company: customers, employees, shareholders, partners, suppliers and communities.",True,community_social_impact;customer_focus;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people,"Values are expanded into three bulleted definitions, with Integrity and Respect for People explicitly naming shareholders, partners, suppliers, competitors and communities as stakeholders. The opening narrative and promise/mission/vision text are unchanged from 2016.",ok,,lilly.com/who-we-are,1,20170106012620,https://web.archive.org/web/20170106012620id_/https://www.lilly.com/who-we-are,248,2016,0.76,substantive,"The 2017 page keeps the same promise, mission, vision and values but adds a detailed definition of the three core values (Integrity, Excellence, Respect for People), introducing innovation, business results and stakeholder concern language not in the 2016 version.",True,"Company overview/About page covering founding history, promise, mission, vision and values.","{""integrity_ethics"": ""Integrity: We conduct our business consistent with all applicable laws and are honest in our dealings with customers, employees, shareholders, partners, suppliers, competitors and the community."", ""performance_results"": ""Excellence: We pursue pharmaceutical innovation, provide high quality products and strive to deliver superior business results."", ""respect_people"": ""Respect for People: We maintain an environment built on mutual respect, openness and individual integrity."", ""innovation"": ""We pursue pharmaceutical innovation, provide high quality products and strive to deliver superior business results."", ""customer_focus"": ""the people we serve starting with those who take our medicines, and extending to health care professionals, employees and the communities in which we live."", ""community_social_impact"": ""Lilly unites caring with discovery to make life better for people around the world.""}",0,1,2,1,0,2,2,0,0,1,0,0
