LLY,Eli Lilly,Healthcare,2020,"Lilly was founded in 1876 by Colonel Eli Lilly, a man committed to creating high-quality medicines that met real needs in an era of unreliable elixirs peddled by questionable characters. His charge to the generations of employees who have followed was this: “Take what you find here and make it better and better.”
More than 140 years later, we remain committed to his vision through every aspect of our business and the people we serve starting with those who take our medicines, and extending to health care professionals, employees and the communities in which we live.
Our Purpose
Lilly unites caring with discovery to create medicines that make life better for people around the world.
Three long established core values guide Lilly in all that we do:
- Integrity: We conduct our business consistent with all applicable laws and are honest in our dealings with customers, employees, shareholders, partners, suppliers, competitors and the community.
- Excellence: We pursue pharmaceutical innovation, provide high quality products and strive to deliver superior business results.
- Respect for People: We maintain an environment built on mutual respect, openness and individual integrity. Respect for people includes our concern for all people who touch or are touched by our company: customers, employees, shareholders, partners, suppliers and communities.",True,community_social_impact;customer_focus;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people,"No notable linguistic shift from 2019; the only change is the opening sentence, which now reads 'Lilly was founded in 1876' instead of 'We were founded in 1876', and the rest of the text is unchanged.",ok,,lilly.com/who-we-are,1,20200221124414,https://web.archive.org/web/20200221124414id_/https://www.lilly.com/who-we-are,211,2019,0.9905,cosmetic,"The 2020 page keeps the same history, purpose statement and three core values (Integrity, Excellence, Respect for People) as 2019, with only minor wording changes ('Lilly was founded' replacing 'We were founded') and a removed line break under 'Our Purpose'.",True,"Company overview page covering founding history, purpose statement and core values, consistent with a general About Us page.","{""integrity_ethics"": ""Integrity: We conduct our business consistent with all applicable laws and are honest in our dealings with customers, employees, shareholders, partners, suppliers, competitors and the community."", ""performance_results"": ""Excellence: We pursue pharmaceutical innovation, provide high quality products and strive to deliver superior business results."", ""respect_people"": ""Respect for People: We maintain an environment built on mutual respect, openness and individual integrity."", ""innovation"": ""We pursue pharmaceutical innovation, provide high quality products and strive to deliver superior business results."", ""customer_focus"": ""the people we serve starting with those who take our medicines, and extending to health care professionals, employees and the communities in which we live."", ""community_social_impact"": ""Lilly unites caring with discovery to create medicines that make life better for people around the world.""}",0,1,2,1,0,2,2,0,0,1,0,0
