LOW,Lowe's,Consumer Discretionary,2020,"More Than Home Improvement
The people we serve are at the heart of everything we do. Our associates have deep home improvement experience and training, and can give you the expert advice you need to do your project right. From urgent repairs to your dream remodel, we designed our business to be there when you need us most.
By the Numbers
~300k
Associates in the United States and Canada
~18m
Customers Served
Per Week
$72.1B
Sales in 2019
$42M
Invested in
Communities in 2019
What We Do
Together, we deliver the right home improvement products, with the best service and value, across every channel and community we serve. Every aspect of our business and strategy is rooted in that mission.
How We Do It
To deliver on our mission and build a sustainable foundation for growth, we frame our strategy with four key pillars: merchandising excellence, supply chain transformation, operational efficiency and customer engagement. These pillars are underpinned by our focus on creating a seamless omni-channel retail experience for our customers.",True,community_social_impact;customer_focus;performance_results,"A new About Us page introduces 'More Than Home Improvement' and states 'The people we serve are at the heart of everything we do', with customer and associate framing. It adds a mission statement ('deliver the right home improvement products... across every channel and community'), a strategy of 'four key pillars' (merchandising excellence, supply chain transformation, operational efficiency, customer engagement) and 'omni-channel retail experience', plus figures such as '~$72.1B' sales and '$42M' invested in communities.",ok,,corporate.lowes.com/who-we-are,1,20201001030214,https://web.archive.org/web/20201001030214id_/https://corporate.lowes.com/who-we-are,171,2019,0.0609,substantive,"The 2019 page was a legal disclaimer about pricing and offers, while the 2020 page is a company overview that adds self-description, mission, strategy pillars and values-related claims.",True,"Company overview page with self-description, mission ('What We Do'), strategy and key figures.","{""customer_focus"": ""The people we serve are at the heart of everything we do."", ""performance_results"": ""merchandising excellence, supply chain transformation, operational efficiency and customer engagement"", ""community_social_impact"": ""$42M Invested in Communities in 2019""}",0,0,0,2,0,1,0,0,0,1,0,0
