What We Do
Together, we deliver the right home improvement products, with the best service and value, across every channel and community we serve. Every aspect of our business and strategy is rooted in that mission.
How We Do It
To deliver on our mission and drive market share acceleration, we have launched our Total Home Strategy. Building upon our strong foundation, we will focus on five key areas: Pro, Online, Installation Services, Localization and Assortment. These five areas of focus are key pillars to the Lowe’s Total Home Strategy, underpinned by our focus on creating a seamless omni-channel retail experience for our customers.",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;customer_focus;performance_results,"The strategy language changes from 'four key pillars' to 'mission and drive market share acceleration' and the 'Total Home Strategy' with five focus areas (Pro, Online, Installation Services, Localization, Assortment). Metrics are updated: customers rise to '20M', sales to '~$90B' and community investment to '$150M+', and 'in the United States and Canada' is retained.",ok,,corporate.lowes.com/who-we-are,1,20220102071647,https://web.archive.org/web/20220102071647id_/https://corporate.lowes.com/who-we-are,188,2021,0.8078,substantive,"The 2022 page replaces the 2021 four-pillar strategy (merchandising excellence, supply chain transformation, operational efficiency, customer engagement) with a five-area Total Home Strategy focused on Pro, Online, Installation Services, Localization and Assortment, and updates figures for customers, sales and community investment, while keeping the same customer-centred self-description and mission wording.",True,"General company overview page covering self-description, mission, strategy and key figures.","{""customer_focus"": ""The people we serve are at the heart of everything we do."", ""performance_results"": ""we have launched our Total Home Strategy"", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""Together, we deliver the right home improvement products, with the best service and value"", ""community_social_impact"": ""$150M+ Invested in Communities in 2020""}",0,0,0,2,1,1,0,0,0,1,0,0
