MDT,Medtronic,Healthcare,2024,"The Medtronic Mission has motivated us to do the extraordinary for 60 years — and counting.
1
To contribute to human welfare by application of biomedical engineering in the research, design, manufacture, and sale of instruments or appliances that alleviate pain, restore health, and extend life.
2
To direct our growth in the areas of biomedical engineering where we display maximum strength and ability; to gather people and facilities that tend to augment these areas; to continuously build on these areas through education and knowledge assimilation; to avoid participation in areas where we cannot make unique and worthy contributions.
3
To strive without reserve for the greatest possible reliability and quality in our products; to be the unsurpassed standard of comparison and to be recognized as a company of dedication, honesty, integrity, and service.
4
To make a fair profit on current operations to meet our obligations, sustain our growth, and reach our goals.
5
To recognize the personal worth of all employees by providing an employment framework that allows personal satisfaction in work accomplished, security, advancement opportunity, and means to share in the company's success.",False,community_social_impact;customer_focus;employee_wellbeing_development;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people,"No notable linguistic shift from 2023. The text is identical, with the same five commitments and the same 60-year framing.",ok,,medtronic.com/us-en/about/mission.html,2,20240409072436,https://web.archive.org/web/20240409072436id_/https://www.medtronic.com/us-en/about/mission.html,186,2023,1.0,none,Text identical to prior snapshot.,True,"Presents the company's mission and values statement, which is a general About-style page, though it is a narrow mission-focused section rather than a full overview.","{""performance_results"": ""To strive without reserve for the greatest possible reliability and quality in our products; to be the unsurpassed standard of comparison"", ""integrity_ethics"": ""to be recognized as a company of dedication, honesty, integrity, and service."", ""customer_focus"": ""to be recognized as a company of dedication, honesty, integrity, and service."", ""innovation"": ""to continuously build on these areas through education and knowledge assimilation"", ""community_social_impact"": ""To contribute to human welfare by application of biomedical engineering"", ""employee_wellbeing_development"": ""To recognize the personal worth of all employees by providing an employment framework that allows personal satisfaction in work accomplished, security, advancement opportunity"", ""respect_people"": ""To recognize the personal worth of all employees by providing an employment framework""}",0,1,1,1,0,2,1,0,0,1,1,0
