MPC,Marathon Petroleum,Energy,2019,"“At Marathon Petroleum, we are proud of the important work we do. It is a privilege to work every day with so many talented people who are dedicated to our values, care about our customers, and make the communities where we operate better places to live.”
– Gary R. Heminger, Chairman and CEO
About Marathon Petroleum
Marathon Petroleum Corporation is a leading, integrated, downstream energy company headquartered in Findlay, Ohio. The company operates the nation’s largest refining system with more than 3 million barrels per day of crude oil capacity across 16 refineries. Marathon Petroleum's marketing system includes branded locations across the United States, including Marathon branded outlets. Speedway LLC, a Marathon Petroleum subsidiary, owns and operates retail convenience stores across the United States. Marathon Petroleum also owns the general partner and majority limited partner interests in two midstream companies, MPLX LP and Andeavor Logistics LP, which own and operate gathering, processing, and fractionation assets, as well as crude oil and light product transportation and logistics infrastructure.
Corporate Citizenship
In practice, the concept of corporate citizenship involves assessing all the potential ways that our actions impact others both inside and outside our operational fence lines. Our commitment to corporate citizenship means being accountable for our actions to a broad range of stakeholders - investors, employees, customers, suppliers, communities, business partners, and others who have a stake in how we operate.
Marathon Petroleum has long-established core values associated with health and safety, diversity and inclusion, environmental stewardship and honesty and integrity. All of these corporate values are vital to our financial performance and to our corporate image and reputation.
History
In one form or another, our company has been helping fuel America since the 1800s. Seriously.
Leadership
Marathon Petroleum is guided by a strategic, passionate team devoted to employees, shareholders and consumers.
Board of Directors
Our strong company benefits from thoughtful oversight in all matters of governance.",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;customer_focus;diversity_inclusion;environment_sustainability;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people;safety,"Text is rewritten as a narrative: ""leading, integrated, downstream energy company"", ""16 refineries"", and a CEO quote on being ""dedicated to our values"". A new ""Corporate Citizenship"" section introduces ""accountable... to a broad range of stakeholders - investors, employees, customers..."" and ""core values associated with health and safety, diversity and inclusion, environmental stewardship and honesty and integrity"".",ok,,marathonpetroleum.com/About,1,20190620170933,https://web.archive.org/web/20190620170933id_/https://www.marathonpetroleum.com/About/,316,2018,0.1368,substantive,"The 2019 page adds explicit core values (health and safety, diversity and inclusion, environmental stewardship, honesty and integrity), a corporate citizenship commitment, and a chairman's message on values, replacing the 2018 purely factual fact list of refining, marketing and midstream assets.",True,"General company overview page covering self-description, corporate citizenship, history, leadership and governance.","{""safety"": ""Marathon Petroleum has long-established core values associated with health and safety, diversity and inclusion, environmental stewardship and honesty and integrity."", ""diversity_inclusion"": ""Marathon Petroleum has long-established core values associated with health and safety, diversity and inclusion, environmental stewardship and honesty and integrity."", ""environment_sustainability"": ""Marathon Petroleum has long-established core values associated with health and safety, diversity and inclusion, environmental stewardship and honesty and integrity."", ""integrity_ethics"": ""Marathon Petroleum has long-established core values associated with health and safety, diversity and inclusion, environmental stewardship and honesty and integrity."", ""customer_focus"": ""who are dedicated to our values, care about our customers, and make the communities where we operate better places to live."", ""community_social_impact"": ""make the communities where we operate better places to live."", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""Our commitment to corporate citizenship means being accountable for our actions to a broad range of stakeholders - investors, employees, customers, suppliers, communities, business partners, and others who have a stake in how we operate."", ""performance_results"": ""All of these corporate values are vital to our financial performance and to our corporate image and reputation."", ""respect_people"": ""Marathon Petroleum is guided by a strategic, passionate team devoted to employees, shareholders and consumers.""}",0,0,2,1,1,1,1,2,2,1,0,2
