Policies & positions
We support public policies that advance the interests of patients, improve public health and promote access to medicines and innovation.",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;customer_focus;diversity_inclusion;environment_sustainability;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;safety,"'Our purpose: We use the power of leading-edge science to save and improve lives around the world' is introduced as an explicit label, and 'bring hope to humanity' appears. New terms include 'foster a diverse and inclusive global workforce', 'operate responsibly', and 'safe, sustainable and healthy future'. The 2021 'invent' tagline is dropped, and 'Our history' is a new section.",ok,,merck.com/about/home.html,1,20220721005647,https://web.archive.org/web/20220721005647id_/http://www.merck.com/about/home.html,534,2021,0.8207,substantive,"The 2022 page replaces the 2021 mission 'to save and improve lives' and 'We invent for a more hopeful future' framing with a 'purpose' statement and 'hope to humanity' language, adds explicit diversity/inclusion and responsible-operation/safe-sustainable-future commitments, and drops the explicit patient-access and partnership/policy emphasis from the headline.",True,"General corporate About Us overview page covering self-description, purpose, values, and areas of focus.","{""innovation"": ""We focus on scientific innovation to deliver medicines and vaccines that may help millions of people around the world."", ""integrity_ethics"": ""operates with the highest standards of integrity"", ""customer_focus"": ""We work to deliver innovations that extend and improve the lives of people with cancer."", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""employs a diverse workforce that values collaboration."", ""performance_results"": ""We aspire to be the premier research-intensive biopharmaceutical company in the world"", ""diversity_inclusion"": ""We foster a diverse and inclusive global workforce"", ""environment_sustainability"": ""enable a safe, sustainable and healthy future for all people and communities."", ""community_social_impact"": ""We believe corporate responsibility is about our health, social, environmental and economic impact on people and communities around the world."", ""safety"": ""enable a safe, sustainable and healthy future for all people and communities.""}",0,2,1,1,1,1,0,1,1,1,0,1
