Read More",True,community_social_impact;diversity_inclusion;employee_wellbeing_development;environment_sustainability;innovation;performance_results,"Major restructuring toward a mission-led, multi-section page: 'Our mission is what drives us to do everything possible to expand human potential' is introduced alongside new terms such as 'diverse', 'inclusive', 'positive impact in communities' and 'more sustainably'. Sections on Innovation, Our Team, Global Community Impact and Sustainable Business Innovation are added, with a quantified goal, 'double our business, while cutting our environmental impact in half'.",ok,,about.nike.com,1,20190103212136,https://web.archive.org/web/20190103212136id_/http://about.nike.com/,209,2018,0.055,substantive,"The 2019 page shifts from a 2018 profile centred on invention and sustainable innovation to a mission framed around expanding human potential, with new emphasis on diversity, community impact and a quantified sustainability goal.",True,"Corporate overview page with mission statement and self-description (Based in Beaverton, Oregon, includes brands), though it also features promotional tiles for innovation, team and community initiatives.","{""innovation"": ""we do everything possible to expand human potential. We do that by creating groundbreaking sport innovations"", ""diversity_inclusion"": ""A Team That's Empowered, Diverse And Inclusive"", ""community_social_impact"": ""The World Is Our Community"", ""environment_sustainability"": ""Our mission is to double our business, while cutting our environmental impact in half."", ""employee_wellbeing_development"": ""by building a creative and diverse global team"", ""performance_results"": ""Our mission is to double our business""}",1,2,0,0,0,1,0,2,2,2,1,0
