ORCL,Oracle,Technology,2016,"- Welcome
- Account
- Sign Out
- Sign In/Register
- Help

About

Welcome to Oracle. This is the place to get basic facts about the company (PDF), or to learn about how Oracle is dedicated to unleashing innovation by simplifying IT. Find out about the Executive and Board of Directors leadership teams who drive the company's direction. Learn about Oracle's History, and the Innovation and Acquisitions that will help shape its future, as well as Customer Successes and Oracle Excellence Awards winners.
Read about how Oracle values the local and global communities of which it is a part through its Corporate Citizenship and Sustainability practices.
Oracle continually applies good corporate governance principles. The composition and activities of the company's Board of Directors, the approach to public disclosure, and the availability of ethics and business conduct resources for employees exemplifies the company's commitment to good corporate governance practices.
Analysts and Investors also have targeted information available to them. Need to talk with someone about Oracle solutions, products, or services? Contact Oracle.
Current or prospective Oracle customers or partners, welcome. Read about our unique Oracle Insight business strategy development program, take a virtual tour of our Customer Visit Center, or learn how other customers and partners are achieving success with Oracle. Partners or prospects can learn more about the many benefits of being part of the Oracle PartnerNetwork. Read further for information about License Management Services, Global Pricing and Licensing, Oracle Suppliers, or Supplier Diversity.
Looking for a Career? Opportunities are plentiful at Oracle. Students should look for the dedicated portal for College Recruiting, or information on programs for Internships. A job and training program dedicated to Injured Veterans is also available. Oracle is a proud proponent of Diversity and Inclusion, and seeks to employ a Global Workforce.
To find the latest information on what's happening at Oracle, take a look at the resources in our Newsroom. Want to attend an Oracle event in person or online? Choose from hundreds of options in our Events listing.
If you're looking for more in-depth information about the company, take a look at these content-rich links. Industry Analyst Reports focus on Oracle's business, strategy, technologies and products. Oracle Publishing puts out award-winning magazines that provide unique viewpoints on business and technology: Oracle Magazine, Profit, and Java Magazine. Oracle Press publishes books on all things Oracle—by experts inside and outside the company. And our global Advertising campaigns highlight Oracle's leadership position in the competitive marketplace in which we compete.",,community_social_impact;diversity_inclusion;employee_wellbeing_development;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results,"Baseline is a broad corporate portal: 'dedicated to unleashing innovation by simplifying IT', with long sections on corporate governance, corporate citizenship and sustainability, analysts and investors, customers and partners, and careers. It states Oracle 'is a proud proponent of Diversity and Inclusion' and seeks 'a Global Workforce'.",ok,,oracle.com/us/corporate/index.html,1,20160101085457,https://web.archive.org/web/20160101085457id_/http://www.oracle.com/us/corporate/index.html,414,,,no_prior,,True,"Corporate About section overview covering leadership, history, governance, investors, and company information, with navigation links and some site chrome.","{""innovation"": ""Oracle is dedicated to unleashing innovation by simplifying IT."", ""integrity_ethics"": ""Oracle continually applies good corporate governance principles."", ""performance_results"": ""our global Advertising campaigns highlight Oracle's leadership position in the competitive marketplace in which we compete."", ""community_social_impact"": ""Read about how Oracle values the local and global communities of which it is a part through its Corporate Citizenship and Sustainability practices."", ""diversity_inclusion"": ""Oracle is a proud proponent of Diversity and Inclusion, and seeks to employ a Global Workforce."", ""employee_wellbeing_development"": ""A job and training program dedicated to Injured Veterans is also available.""}",0,2,1,0,0,1,0,1,0,1,1,0
