SLB,SLB (Schlumberger),Energy,2023,"Our story begins with what it truly means to be a technology innovator. It stems from a common sense of purpose that unites the people of SLB who represent more than 172 nationalities. We provide the global energy industry with leading digital solutions and ground-breaking technologies that enable performance and sustainability, and our innovations help industry-at-large to decarbonize.
With expertise in more than 120 countries, we work in close partnership with customers to create industry-changing technologies that unlock and decarbonize reliable energy for every community—including those we live and work in.
Our purpose:Together, we create amazing technology that unlocks access to energy for the benefit of all.
We’ve always built our business around our customers and their endeavors; they are at the center of everything we do. Bringing together talented people from all over the globe, we’re working on the industry’s most complex and pressing challenges to anticipate and align with our customers’ needs. We want to be their performance partner of choice.
To achieve this goal and deliver the best results, we must combine our unique talents and our collective expertise—not just within SLB but by working closely with our suppliers, contractors, and business partners.
We are industry leaders because of our exceptional and talented people. They are the core that drives our purpose and integrity, which fuel our belief that everyone should have the opportunity to reach their greatest potential. Ever-evolving and constantly innovating, we transcend every cultural and technological boundary set before us. Indeed, it is our diversity that makes us stronger. Together, we achieve more.
We are SLB, and we are leading the energy industry forward—together.
Our industry has a vital role to play in the global energy transition, and SLB is evolving for that exciting future. Discover how our portfolio of Transition Technologies can reduce your carbon footprint and accelerate the path to net zero.
- Bring Balance Back to Our Planet Our planet needs balance to thrive, for the climate, for people, and for nature Together, we will pave the way through better practices, innovative technologies, and the commitment to help others. View
- Our Values Our Promise and Commitment to you We are facing the world’s greatest balancing act—how to simultaneously meet the world’s growing energy demands while rapidly reducing harmful emissions. View
- Our Guiding Principles SLB is committed to providing technologies and services that enhance and optimize our customers' performance while creating mutual value for all involved. SLB looks to three core values, people, technology, and performance, to guide the decisions we make as we pursue our ambitions. View
- Our History With bold thinking, we’ve established ourselves as early adopters of digital solutions and pioneers of new mindsets to tackle the net-zero challenge. A legacy and culture of pushing the limits of what technology can do. View
- Our Global Footprint We are local. Everywhere. With operations in over 120 countries, we bring a strong focus on our customers and regional dynamics. View
- Our Technology Development The future of E&P innovation Leveraging the latest science and technology to optimize operations and solve E&P challenges. View
- Schlumberger Foundation Actively supporting STEM education for women. The Schlumberger Foundation supports education, strengthens university faculties, and mitigates obstacles faced by women scientists. View
- Case Studies See our solutions in action In-depth analysis of real-world situations View
- Our Alumni SLB employees, current and past, made us who we are today. Keeping you connected to news, information, and opportunities View",True,collaboration_teamwork;community_social_impact;customer_focus;diversity_inclusion;employee_wellbeing_development;environment_sustainability;innovation;integrity_ethics;performance_results;respect_people,"'Decarbonize' and 'decarbonize' become core terms ('help industry-at-large to decarbonize', 'unlock and decarbonize reliable energy'), with 'net-zero challenge' and 'carbon footprint' language added. The company is now 'SLB' throughout, with the new brand name replacing Schlumberger, and the page adds a navigation list of sections including 'Bring Balance Back to Our Planet' and 'Our Values'. Nationalities are updated to 'more than 172'.",ok,,slb.com/about/who-we-are,1,20230120121148,https://web.archive.org/web/20230120121148id_/https://www.slb.com/about/who-we-are,578,2022,0.5935,substantive,"Decarbonisation and climate balance are now a central framing (new Bring Balance Back to Our Planet section and innovations described as helping industry decarbonise), the prior reference to safer energy access is dropped, and new sections on values, principles and history are added, so commitments and self-description have shifted.",True,"Company overview page covering self-description, purpose, customer commitment, values and principles, with teaser links to sub-sections such as history, footprint, technology and alumni.","{""innovation"": ""Ever-evolving and constantly innovating, we transcend every cultural and technological boundary set before us."", ""customer_focus"": ""they are at the center of everything we do."", ""collaboration_teamwork"": ""by working closely with our suppliers, contractors, and business partners"", ""performance_results"": ""We are industry leaders because of our exceptional and talented people."", ""environment_sustainability"": ""Our planet needs balance to thrive, for the climate, for people, and for nature"", ""respect_people"": ""They are the core that drives our purpose and integrity"", ""diversity_inclusion"": ""Indeed, it is our diversity that makes us stronger."", ""community_social_impact"": ""Actively supporting STEM education for women."", ""employee_wellbeing_development"": ""everyone should have the opportunity to reach their greatest potential"", ""integrity_ethics"": ""They are the core that drives our purpose and integrity""}",0,2,1,2,2,2,1,1,2,1,1,0
SLB,SLB (Schlumberger),Energy,2024,"Creating the energy technologies our world needs. Today.
Our collective future depends on transforming the global energy system and establishing a lower-carbon world. At SLB, we are committed to tackling this challenge by driving energy innovation across industry, supporting net-zero targets, and going further—every day—for a balanced planet.
Industry is at a crossroads. We believe that science, technology, and engineering will be key to getting us where we need to go, and we must drive innovation like never before.
48%
Of STEM new hires in 2021 were women

AA
Rating Morgan Stanley Capital International, 2021

80
Years SLB has supported sustainable access to energy in Africa

For nearly a century, SLB has has driven innovation in the energy industry, unlocking access to energy for the benefit of all.
SLB’s leadership team brings significant global experience in energy, engineering, finance, operations, and technology.
Health, Safety, and the Environment (HSE)

Meeting the highest standards of human health and safety, and environmental protection.

Diversity & Inclusion

Long-standing commitment to national and cultural diversity.

Corporate Governance

SLB corporate governance, principles, and practices.

Find out how to become a supplier to SLB.
Explore
