TSLA,Tesla,Consumer Discretionary,2023,"About Us
Accelerating the World's Transition to Sustainable Energy
The Future is Sustainable
We’re building a world powered by solar energy, running on batteries and transported by electric vehicles. Explore the most recent impact of our products, people and supply chain.
To shift humanity away from fossil fuels, we need extreme scale. Headquartered in Texas, we operate six huge, vertically integrated factories across three continents. With over 100,000 employees, our teams design, build, sell and service our products in-house.
Using a first-principles approach, we solve some of the world’s biggest problems. If you’ve done exceptional work, join us in tackling the next generation of engineering, manufacturing and operational challenges.",True,environment_sustainability;innovation;performance_results,"Full replacement: the heading becomes 'About Us' with the tagline 'Accelerating the World's Transition to Sustainable Energy' and new phrases 'The Future is Sustainable', 'extreme scale', 'vertically integrated factories', 'first-principles approach' and 'over 100,000 employees'. Product histories, safety-rating claims, pricing claims and the mission sentence 'to accelerate the world's transition to sustainable energy' now appear only in the tagline, and the tone shifts from consumer-facing to recruitment- and sustainability-oriented.",ok,,tesla.com/about,3,20230104060358,https://web.archive.org/web/20230104060358id_/https://www.tesla.com/about,109,2022,0.0408,substantive,"The 2023 page drops the detailed product history, safety training and product-accessibility claims of the 2022 page and reframes the self-description around scale, solar and a first-principles engineering approach, with a recruiting call to action.",True,"Company overview page with self-description and mission-style statements, though it is brief and includes a recruiting call to action.","{""environment_sustainability"": ""Accelerating the World's Transition to Sustainable Energy"", ""innovation"": ""Using a first-principles approach, we solve some of the world's biggest problems."", ""performance_results"": ""we operate six huge, vertically integrated factories across three continents.""}",0,1,0,0,0,1,0,0,2,0,0,0
