VLO,Valero Energy,Energy,2020,"Guiding Principles
The Highest Standards
We are guided by five principles, in Safety, Environment, Community, Employees, and Governance.
Leadership
Guided by Exceptional Leaders
Our executive team and board of directors are committed to operations excellence, disciplined management of capital and long-term value.
Our Story
Advancing the Future of Energy
Valero is leading through innovation, ingenuity and unmatched execution to responsibly meet the world's growing demand for reliable and sustainable energy.
Our Locations
Valero, through its subsidiaries, owns 15 petroleum refineries in the United States, Canada and the United Kingdom, and 14 ethanol process plants in the U.S.
Valero is headquartered in San Antonio, with offices in Montreal, London, Mexico City and Lima, Peru, and a Payment Service Center in Amarillo, Texas.
More About Valero
